<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/31/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The issue of a sum not exceeding one hundred and sixty-three billion four hundred and forty-seven million seven hundred and fifty-six thousand ringgit (RM163,447,756,000) from the Consolidated Fund for the service of the year 2016 is hereby authorised and that sum is appropriated for the purposes specified in the Schedule."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/31/eng@> .
